      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LOLLIPOP KIRRA (8) showed good early speed and led throughout to score her maiden two back then finished second last start and beaten one length at this track over 300m (17.52). Yet to win here but has run some good races. Going well and can find winning form this time. TRALEE BUBBA (1) comes off an average effort last start when eighth at this track over 300m behind Pa's Shake (18.22) in a Grade 5. Placed at her previous run. The form out of last race has been strong. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. MISSY MISCHIEF (2) finished in the minors last start over the 318m at Dubbo but ran a strong 18.34 last start. Smart time latest and looks a key chance on that form. KEY JASPER (7) jumps at a shorter trip and still warrants respect.",
